> 
> Do I have the patience to go back to the Mine Town altar or not, and if
> so, how often? *No-one* is forcing you to sacrifice things or to
> buc-identify things. There are other options, like keeping your pet
> alive to identify things and there are lots of examples of people
> ascending atheist, ie without ever sacrificing (and praying). It's
> comparable tot the "do I make a stash, and how often do I return there"
